    [*] --> Capabilities : save OK, generation G2
    Capabilities --> AskServer : capabilities loaded
    Capabilities --> CapsKept : capabilities fetch failed
    CapsKept --> AskServer : last answer, or next preview poll
    AskServer --> Reread : another check holds the ticket
    Reread --> AskServer : that check finished
    AskServer --> QuietWait : status read failed (offline, 5xx)
    QuietWait --> AskServer : backoff, reconnect or foreground
    AskServer --> AlreadyPublished : server phase published
    AskServer --> Cooling : too hot to start
    Cooling --> AskServer : cooled down
    AskServer --> NeedsChange : recipe this iPhone can't render, server told
    AskServer --> NeedsUpdate : recipe newer than this build, server told
    AskServer --> ServerNeedsAttention : server phase needs_attention
    AskServer --> AutoResume : reaped, or outdated and now updated
    AutoResume --> AskServer : new identity, same recipe
    AskServer --> Preparing : awaiting_device, new identity
    AskServer --> Syncing : video for this request exists, upload it

    Preparing --> Superseded : server no longer current
    Preparing --> Parked : offline or 5xx
    Preparing --> Rendering : clips resolved
    Preparing --> OriginalMissing : original not on this iPhone
    Rendering --> LocalReady : export finished
    Rendering --> Parked : app left Kria
    Rendering --> Paused : you tap Stop rendering
    Rendering --> Killed : app killed
    Parked --> Preparing : next check resumes it
    Killed --> AskServer : you reopen the project

    LocalReady --> Superseded : server moved on
    LocalReady --> Syncing : still current
    Syncing --> Synced : publish accepted
    Syncing --> Superseded : publish says superseded
    Syncing --> Parked : upload blip, retry without rendering
    Superseded --> AskServer : the save's own check, run again

    Synced --> EditorReady : variant ready (or a newer one, read twice)
    AlreadyPublished --> EditorReady : variant ready

    NeedsChange --> Chat : Review in chat
    Chat --> AskServer : the new version is pinned for this iPhone
    NeedsUpdate --> AutoResume : Update Kria, reopen
    ServerNeedsAttention --> ServerRetry : Retry device render
    OriginalMissing --> ServerRetry : Find original files, all back
    Paused --> ServerRetry : Resume rendering
    ServerRetry --> AskServer : new identity (same one after a pause)
    ServerRetry --> NeedsChange : requires_change
    ServerRetry --> NeedsUpdate : requires_update
    EditorReady --> [*]

